    '概念灵感来自冰山、海浪、鱼群、漩涡与水面纹理。蓝色与冰白色构成主调，辅以深色和暖金细节；材料参考覆盖用餐区吊灯、墙面饰材、收银与陈列区域、咖啡桌及地面纹理，为空间的波浪形态与水感表面建立统一基调。':'The concept draws on icebergs, waves, schools of fish, whirlpools, and water textures. Blue and icy white form the palette, accented by deep tones and warm gold. Material references for dining pendants, wall finishes, checkout and display areas, coffee tables, and flooring unify the room’s flowing forms and watery surfaces.',
    '顾客动线与空间意象':'Guest Circulation & Spatial Concept',
    '沿曲线展开的用餐路径':'A Dining Route that Follows the Curves',
