    '流线天花与临窗座席':'Flowing Ceiling & Window-Side Seating',
    '室内透视展示波浪形天花在空间中连续起伏，环绕式座席沿曲线排列，靠窗设置深蓝色桌椅。蓝白地面将不同的用餐区域连接起来，形成从宽阔共享座位到相对私密临窗桌位的层次变化。':'The interior view shows a wave-like ceiling flowing through the room. Curved banquettes define the seating, with deep-blue tables and chairs by the windows. Blue-and-white flooring connects shared dining areas with more intimate window-side tables.',
