    '近景突出起伏的波纹墙面、弧形浅色构件和垂直悬挂装饰。蓝色天花与点状灯光形成背景层次，细部材质和光影共同延续水流与水滴的主题表达。':'A close view highlights rippling walls, pale curved elements, and vertical hanging details. The blue ceiling and pin lights add depth, while materials and shadows continue the themes of flowing water and droplets.',
