    '企业前台 · 木作设计':'Corporate Reception Desk · Millwork Design',
    '前台平面、立面、剖面、材料标注与轴测表达':'Reception desk plans, elevations, sections, material annotations, and axonometric view',
    '设计图板与构造表达':'Design Boards & Construction Details',
    '方案与平面':'Proposal & Plan',
    '立面详图':'Elevation Details',
    '剖面与节点':'Sections & Details',
    '轴测图':'Axonometric',
    '前台木作设计图板':'Reception Desk Millwork Boards',
    '图板由整体方案逐步深入柜体立面、剖面节点与轴测表达。点击图板可放大查看。':'The boards develop from the overall proposal into cabinet elevations, section details, and an axonometric view. Select a board to enlarge it.',
    '方案效果与平面尺寸':'Proposal Rendering & Plan Dimensions',
    '自然主题与绿植墙相融':'A Nature-Inspired Design Integrated with a Living Wall',
    '项目以自然为主题，运用木饰面、木格栅和花槽，使前台与背景植物墙融为一体。正面效果展示格栅立面、水平装饰线和内嵌花槽；背面视图呈现工作侧的柜体与储物空间。平面图标注柜台转折、工作面及各段尺寸关系。':'Nature informs the design through timber finishes, slatted screens, and integrated planters that connect the desk to the planted wall behind it. The front view shows the slatted elevation, horizontal trim, and built-in planter; the rear shows the work counter and storage. The plan documents the desk bends, work surface, and dimensions.',
    '柜体立面与饰面标注':'Cabinet Elevation & Finish Notes',
    '木饰面、格栅与无障碍柜台':'Timber Finishes, Slats & Accessible Counter',
    '立面标注了带桃花心木纹理塑料贴面的中密度纤维板、胡桃木饰面无障碍柜台、桃花心木面板、松木装饰条与半英寸木格栅。柜体配置抽屉、柜门、铝合金五金和白色花槽；底部踢脚及柜台高度根据一般使用区与无障碍使用区分别处理。':'The elevation specifies MDF with a mahogany-grain laminate, an accessible counter with walnut veneer, mahogany panels, pine trim, and half-inch wood slats. Drawers, cabinet doors, aluminum hardware, and white planters complete the desk. The plinth and counter heights distinguish standard and accessible service zones.',
    '剖面构造与节点':'Sections & Construction Details',
    '柜体基层与连接节点':'Cabinet Substructure & Connections',
    '剖面分别说明无障碍柜台和柜体的支撑方式，节点展示台面、板材基层、抽屉、背板、踢脚与装饰构件的层次。材料图例涵盖胶合板、塑料贴面、桃花心木格栅、中密度纤维板、胡桃木和松木；局部节点还标明木支撑、铝合金五金及嵌入式 LED 灯带。':'Sections explain the support for the accessible counter and cabinet. Details show the layered countertop, panel substrate, drawers, back panel, plinth, and trim. The material key includes plywood, laminate, mahogany slats, MDF, walnut, and pine; connection details also locate wood supports, aluminum hardware, and recessed LED strips.',
    '前台整体轴测表达':'Reception Desk Axonometric',
    '整体形态与构件组合':'Overall Form & Component Assembly',
    '轴测图将转折式柜台的整体形态、不同高度的服务台面、花槽、抽屉、木格栅和饰面层次组合呈现，并通过尺寸标注补充构件尺度与连接关系。':'The axonometric view brings together the desk’s angled form, service counters at different heights, planters, drawers, timber slats, and finish layers. Dimensions clarify component sizes and connections.',
    '项目位于多伦多 Old Weston Road，面向无家可归者提供学习、交流与日常支持空间。设计以被动式建筑为基础，整合 LEED 与 WELL 策略，通过节能、自然环境连接和包容性空间规划，营造温暖、可持续的社区资源中心。':'Located on Old Weston Road in Toronto, the project provides spaces for learning, connection, and everyday support for people experiencing homelessness. Passive design principles and LEED and WELL strategies guide energy efficiency, connection to nature, and inclusive planning for a warm, sustainable community resource centre.',
    '社区资源中心':'Community Resource Centre',
    '合作项目 · COLLABORATION':'Collaborative Project',
    '项目概览海报':'Project Overview Poster',
    '项目定位、可持续设计与空间方案':'Project Vision, Sustainable Design & Spatial Proposal',
    '海报内容中文导览':'Poster Guide',
    '项目位于多伦多 189 Old Weston Road，目标是打造一座被动式社区资源中心，为社区成员提供活动、休息、阅读、课堂与护理支持空间，并通过无障碍卫生间和淋浴设施提升使用便利性。方案倡导低碳与可回收材料，结合 LEED 与 WELL 目标，营造兼顾能源效率、健康、社会交往和环境可持续性的包容空间。海报还概览了绿色屋顶与太阳能板、季节性遮阳和采光策略、室内外饰面材料、功能平面及建筑立面；开放式平面旨在促进社区互动与协作。':'Located at 189 Old Weston Road in Toronto, the project envisions a passive-design community resource centre with spaces for activities, rest, reading, classes, and care support. Accessible washrooms and showers improve ease of use. Low-carbon and recycled materials, alongside LEED and WELL goals, support energy efficiency, health, social connection, and environmental sustainability. The poster also summarizes the green roof and solar panels, seasonal shading and daylight strategies, interior and exterior finishes, floor plan, and elevations. An open plan encourages community interaction and collaboration.',
    '项目概念与服务使命':'Project Concept & Community Mission',
    '场地位于安大略省多伦多市 189 Old Weston Road。资源中心以':'Located at 189 Old Weston Road in Toronto, Ontario, the resource centre is dedicated to ',
