    '为目标，规划活动、休息、阅读、课堂与护理空间，为无家可归者提供相互连接的学习与支持环境。建筑采用被动式设计理念，兼顾冬季保温、夏季遮阳、无障碍通行以及与周边自然环境的联系。':' . It brings together activity, rest, reading, classroom, and care spaces to provide connected learning and support for people experiencing homelessness. Passive design balances winter insulation, summer shading, accessibility, and a connection with the surrounding natural environment.',
    '能源与水资源：':'Energy & Water:',
    '采用被动式建筑策略、南向采光、外遮阳、感应 LED、太阳能板、绿色屋顶、保温围护结构及雨水回收；低流量水龙头与淋浴设备减少用水。':'Passive design, southern daylight, exterior shading, sensor-controlled LEDs, solar panels, a green roof, an insulated envelope, and rainwater collection reduce energy demand. Low-flow taps and showers conserve water.',
    '健康与室内环境：':'Health & Indoor Environment:',
    '选用低 VOC、可再生或回收材料，保持室内空气流通，并通过窗景、户外空间和自然景观加强人与自然的连接。WELL 策略聚焦心理健康，设置阅读、课堂及定期教育活动。':'Low-VOC, renewable, and recycled materials support healthy indoor air. Views, outdoor spaces, and natural landscapes strengthen the connection to nature. WELL strategies focus on mental health through reading areas, classrooms, and recurring educational activities.',
    '材料：':'Materials:',
    '图板列出稻壳石灰抹灰、竹地板、回收软木地板、竹墙板、高性能混凝土及半透明光伏玻璃等材料，兼顾耐久、低碳与节能需求。':'The boards specify rice-husk lime plaster, bamboo flooring, recycled cork flooring, bamboo wall panels, high-performance concrete, and translucent photovoltaic glass, balancing durability, low carbon impact, and energy performance.',
    '场地总平面说明建筑、道路、步行与绿化的关系；夏季和冬季日照路径图分析太阳高度变化与建筑朝向。平面布置整合接待、活动、阅读、课堂、护理支持与共享休息区域，以清晰的功能组织支持多样的社区使用方式。':'The site plan relates the building to roads, pedestrian routes, and planting. Summer and winter sun-path studies examine seasonal solar angles and orientation. The floor plan combines reception, activity, reading, classroom, care-support, and shared lounge areas in a clear layout for varied community use.',
    '南北立面与东西向剖面展示建筑体量、窗洞、屋顶绿化及室内外关系。夏季剖面说明遮阳与树荫如何减少直射热量；冬季剖面利用较低角度的阳光深入室内；横向通风剖面则呈现空气流动路径。':'North and south elevations and east-west sections show building massing, openings, roof planting, and indoor-outdoor relationships. Summer sections show how shading and trees reduce direct heat; winter sections use low-angle sunlight to warm interior spaces; a cross-ventilation section traces airflow.',
    '效果图以季节变化呈现图书馆的日光环境，并展示休息区与绿色屋顶。绿色屋顶结合太阳能板，回应建筑节能、雨水管理与户外环境品质等设计目标。':'Seasonal library renderings show changing daylight alongside the lounge and green roof. Combined with solar panels, the green roof supports energy efficiency, rainwater management, and a better outdoor environment.',
