    'Tabitha · 边境军旅与个人营帐':'Tabitha · Frontier Army & Personal Camp',
    '沉着领军 · 追查暗线':'Steady Command · Uncovering a Conspiracy',
    'Tabitha 是家中长女，以冷静、坚韧和善于谋略著称。她精通双刃与长剑，拥有出色耐力。加入边境军后，她逐渐赢得尊重与信任，晋升为地区领袖，带队深入荒野寻找资源与机会；同时调查军中叛徒，在暗处揭开阴谋。':'As the eldest sibling, Tabitha is known for her calm resolve and strategic mind. She excels with paired blades and a longsword and has exceptional stamina. In the frontier army, she earns trust and rises to regional command, leading expeditions into the wilderness while investigating a traitor within the ranks.',
