    '潜在继承人的身份使他成为武林势力觊觎的目标。为保护自身，他创立组织并将旧宅改造为总部，通过隐秘行动收集情报、建立人脉，逐渐在武林中声名鹊起。返乡时，他与成员同行，希望解决继承问题后回归平静生活。':'As a potential heir, Mortimer becomes a target for powerful martial factions. To protect himself, he forms an organization and turns the old estate into its headquarters. Covert operations help him gather intelligence and build alliances, earning him influence in the martial world. He returns home with his members, hoping to settle the succession and resume a peaceful life.',
