    '他常与团队成员聚在赏金酒馆，从任务墙揭取委托。清除盘踞已久的盗匪后，Chasel 在民间声望达到高点，带队返乡竞逐家族产业，希望为家族带来更大的成就与荣誉。':'Chasel and his team often meet at the bounty tavern to take jobs from its noticeboard. After clearing out the entrenched bandits, his standing among the people reaches a high point. He leads his companions home to compete for the family legacy and bring greater achievement and honor to the clan.',
