    'Lume 艺术疗愈中心以“节律”为设计核心，将静心反思与社群交流组织为连贯的空间体验。项目位于加拿大安大略省密西沙加市的 Small Arms Inspection Building（SAIB），室内面积约 15,000 平方英尺。设计利用原有天窗引入自然光，以中央绿色空间组织动线，并通过私密、半私密及开放区域，支持个体疗愈、团体活动与社区艺术项目。':'Lume Art Therapy Centre is organized around the idea of rhythm, connecting quiet reflection with community interaction. Located in the Small Arms Inspection Building (SAIB) in Mississauga, Ontario, the project spans approximately 15,000 square feet. Existing skylights bring in daylight, while a central green space anchors circulation. Private, semi-private, and open areas support individual therapy, group activities, and community arts programs.',
