    '61.4% 偏好 2–4 人的小组活动；圆桌或椭圆桌较受欢迎，咖啡区及身心健康支持设施也获得认可。':'A total of 61.4% preferred small groups of two to four. Round and oval tables were popular, as were a café area and facilities supporting physical and mental well-being.',
