    '设计建议':'Design Recommendations',
    '保持视线开敞，并以灵活布局兼顾 2–4 人小组活动与个人舒适度；采用低饱和中性色、绿植、天然材料和柔和触感，同时预留适度技术设施的整合空间。':'Maintain open sightlines and use a flexible layout that supports groups of two to four as well as individual comfort. Use muted neutrals, planting, natural materials, and soft textures, while allowing for discreet integration of technology.',
